{
  "name": "@dsh-pack/knowledge",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "description": "知识库层（DSH 插件包 · 元包）：2 个知识类插件：Cardian 知识中心（RepoWiki / 知识卡片 / 记忆，落地到本地 Obsidian 仓库）与 Graph Memory（跨会话知识图谱 + PageRank / 社区检测 / 向量召回）。两者默认 disabled，装上后在设置页自行打开。",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "license": "MIT",
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "default": "./lib/index.js"
    },
    "./cordis.patch.yml": "./cordis.patch.yml",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    }
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "@dsh-pack/dsh-cardian": "^0.14.0",
    "@dsh-pack/graph-memory": "^1.6.0-beta.1"
  }
}
